5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about the yard equipment. Can the new system handle our old devices?,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I need to see the real cost. Headline prices hide the long-term drain.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Who is actually in charge when the system fails? I need clear ownership.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I hate when things break and nobody fixes them. Who owns the repairs?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must look at the people. The system serves the hands that work it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
