35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The yard devices are a mess. The 2021 trial failed because of spreadsheets.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, That explains the hidden costs. The board keeps cutting capital, but operating costs keep rising.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, The support is a mess. Last winter, nobody owned the outage for two days.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, That is scary! I found that the admins are leaving. Who will fix it?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, The supervisors are the key. They know the work, but they resist new rules.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, If the board cuts capital, we can't afford a big cutover.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, Exactly. We need a vendor who charges for outcomes, not just licenses.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, The warehouse rules changed twice this year. The plan is already dead.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I saw the upgrade history. They skipped three updates! That is why it breaks.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, The people are stretched thin. We must choose a path that respects their limits.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I think we need a vendor who understands our yard chaos.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,I agree. But the price must be transparent. No hidden fees.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,I need a vendor who assigns a single point of contact for failures.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,I want a vendor who fixes things quickly! No more waiting for weeks!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"I seek a vendor who trains the supervisors, not just the admins. The roots must be strong.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,Let's vote for the one who fits our messy reality.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,The numbers must be clean. I will vote for transparency.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I will vote for the one who owns the failure. No more pointing fingers.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Rin,,I will vote for the one who fixes it fast! Let's choose!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,I will vote for the one who honors the people. The system must serve the soul.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
