71,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,I am still worried about the long-term cost. But the on-site support is a strong point.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I am voting for Anchor. The single point of contact is what I need.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I am voting for Anchor! They will fix it fast!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,I am voting for Anchor. They will train the supervisors and honor the people.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
